{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>現年53歲的區永權是TVB《東張西望》元祖台柱。他與圈外太太Clara結婚17年，育有大仔區靖嵐（Aidan）及細仔區靖崋（Ambrose），一家四口居於貝沙灣豪宅多年，不時周遊列國。區永權曾接受雜誌訪問，提到家裏的樓和車都是寫太太名字，而太太亦擔任他的專屬造型師，替他弄頭髮和化妝。近日是區永權太太生日，也是區永權與太太共度的第20個生日，區永權甜蜜地在Instagram上載合照曬愛。</p><figure><img alt=\"區永權（Albert）是TVB《東張西望》元祖台柱。（FACEBOOK：區永權 albert au）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200603/344869723168706560.jpeg/-9dH7WdXk-o9xcidM7ObnPMKk9wci1eGeZm3CXmZtwk\"/><figcaption>區永權（Albert）是TVB《東張西望》元祖台柱。（FACEBOOK：區永權 albert au）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"區永權一家。（IG：@mr.albertau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3950736/org/47d3603fa7688044a7ec56c09d3ed474.jpg/50PE3jJV3mMbLUQcYDj7Oxef2Zf9MWGPIzfsRyM37Ec\"/><figcaption>區永權一家。（IG：@mr.albertau）</figcaption></figure><p>區永權分享與太太甜蜜合照：老公就晒妳</p><p>區永權分享一張與太太的甜蜜合照，照片中區永權攬住太太，太太小鳥依人依偎在區永權懷中，結婚17年仍然恩愛十足！區永權發文祝太太生日快樂，更承諾會完全遷就老婆，他說：「今年，係我陪妳共同渡過嘅第20個生辰。祝生日快樂，身體健康，想要乜？就有乜！例如⋯老公就晒妳，仔仔孝順妳，青春常伴妳，財富向妳衝埋嚟！恭喜恭喜！」</p><figure><img alt=\"區永權在Instagram發文祝太太生日快樂。（IG@mr.albertau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197213080841490432761504.png/MKEPZPsAvnn5zxKASp3VqU5PTwqVv_jsUQ0p9VENKfU\"/><figcaption>區永權在Instagram發文祝太太生日快樂。（IG@mr.albertau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"區永權承諾會遷就太太。（IG@mr.albertau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20261111/1197213078475771904198724.png/BFlP4ibPZlMqNtOolbMqw7AwV8mqvRbIuS2PALktjwA\"/><figcaption>區永權承諾會遷就太太。（IG@mr.albertau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"區永權主持《東張西望》。（FACEBOOK：區永權 albert au）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20200603/344869957886152704.jpeg/8_Nj9lW8VXSvErU3FAYabatOZJ8lDl3nfn1ckn59XJI\"/><figcaption>區永權主持《東張西望》。（FACEBOOK：區永權 albert au）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"區永權一家經常出遊。（IG：@mr.albertau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3950739/org/f56a612cda498c950a25ba2631a69223.jpg/P3UISSwyW8jZCrytXJ1s1Ds8Z6dQOfiBRGrh7URq4e0\"/><figcaption>區永權一家經常出遊。（IG：@mr.albertau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"區永權屋企景色好靚。（IG：@mr.albertau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3950738/org/a8b86cd638c89a75d07d719484b97d06.jpg/SqR8A7PdSzZQWCEdIDkHE3qaxls7tUkP_2RwY_9kcGM\"/><figcaption>區永權屋企景色好靚。（IG：@mr.albertau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"區永權一家經常出遊。（IG：@mr.albertau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3950737/org/1bdc147fb5f5505f7a0aa5e79664a294.jpg/C57Y3E2z28lSS7MmogZiogKlwZF6WQgpIUb-_yFG_v8\"/><figcaption>區永權一家經常出遊。（IG：@mr.albertau）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"區永權一家到北海道滑雪。（IG：@mr.albertau）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/3950681/org/b465d53faffec152c61336fe65a3867c.jpg/UC96IhfieG1bmNVr5ALdLrLrPkdQb_km8ThoRfE4aEU\"/><figcaption>區永權一家到北海道滑雪。（IG：@mr.albertau）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-14T11:24:10.639316+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":663,"images":9,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-14T11:00:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:38.412612+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-14T11:17:38.412612+00:00","content_hash":"889a4d250a9ecbfe7ad26006c47e27b0bd36fdb4cb84638f7217c46b89bdcda4","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}